(4258179, 614658, 37444, '<td valign="top">Besides making me hungry for treats, the strawberry itself is the subject here, while the dripping chocolate is superfluous.</td>', 'Besides making me hungry for treats, the strawberry itself is the subject here, while the dripping chocolate is superfluous.', '2007-11-19 13:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
