(4258182, 614067, 9462, '<td valign="top">Yours is the definitely the fastest stopped motion of the bunch but there''s no real sense of motion, which I bet will be the downfall (for the challenge) of this super cool astro-photo.<br/> <br/>Can I come play with your toys?</td>', 'Yours is the definitely the fastest stopped motion of the bunch but there''s no real sense of motion, which I bet will be the downfall (for the challenge) of this super cool astro-photo. Can I come play with your toys?', '2007-11-19 13:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
