(4259505, 614657, 23002, '<td valign="top">Cute little guy.  He is certainly in full flight!  Ghe OOF background help this a lot, and the muted colours match his coat, which is nice.  I like the framing that gives him room to run into it... 7</td>', 'Cute little guy.  He is certainly in full flight!  Ghe OOF background help this a lot, and the muted colours match his coat, which is nice.  I like the framing that gives him room to run into it... 7', '2007-11-19 23:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
