(4260028, 614584, 80908, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - tweaking the contrast and saturations here could have made the subject ''pop'' a bit more and give it some impact. I love the concentration on his face! I think that the only difference between this and a GREAT shot is a little more PP.</td>', 'Nice shot - tweaking the contrast and saturations here could have made the subject ''pop'' a bit more and give it some impact. I love the concentration on his face! I think that the only difference between this and a GREAT shot is a little more PP.', '2007-11-20 09:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260029, 613735, 84440, '<td valign="top">colors are pretty. to me there is just too much going on. the sun or sunflower is difficult to make-out - but oh, it''s a water drop - almost didn''t notice. I can''t see the water drop action very well which is probably supposed to be the main event here. a different angle needed? imo</td>', 'colors are pretty. to me there is just too much going on. the sun or sunflower is difficult to make-out - but oh, it''s a water drop - almost didn''t notice. I can''t see the water drop action very well which is probably supposed to be the main event here. a different angle needed? imo', '2007-11-20 09:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260031, 614699, 84440, '<td valign="top">imo this just doesn''t create an interesting composition or pleasing effect.</td>', 'imo this just doesn''t create an interesting composition or pleasing effect.', '2007-11-20 09:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260033, 612859, 80908, '<td valign="top">Superb angle! Really clean image too. I can''t come up with anything else useful to say...</td>', 'Superb angle! Really clean image too. I can''t come up with anything else useful to say...', '2007-11-20 09:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260036, 614059, 80908, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, with good angle, but the colour fringing on the wings and eye is very offputting.</td>', 'Nice shot, with good angle, but the colour fringing on the wings and eye is very offputting.', '2007-11-20 09:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260039, 614709, 84440, '<td valign="top">very busy. improved if bottom upholstery is cropped off. not really stop motion but pleasing blur.</td>', 'very busy. improved if bottom upholstery is cropped off. not really stop motion but pleasing blur.', '2007-11-20 09:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260043, 614700, 84440, '<td valign="top">i really like the leaves. wish there was a better background. a small child on a bike would be nice. imo</td>', 'i really like the leaves. wish there was a better background. a small child on a bike would be nice. imo', '2007-11-20 09:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260046, 612566, 80908, '<td valign="top">I love how the models look so natural in this one! ;o) Such a spur of the moment shot it is difficult to suggest realistic improvements but a little more light on the left would have been nice.</td>', 'I love how the models look so natural in this one! ;o) Such a spur of the moment shot it is difficult to suggest realistic improvements but a little more light on the left would have been nice.', '2007-11-20 09:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260058, 614699, 80908, '<td valign="top">Needs more of interest to add impact to the shot.</td>', 'Needs more of interest to add impact to the shot.', '2007-11-20 09:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260067, 614533, 80908, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but doesn''t seem to be in focus to me. Also a little dark.</td>', 'Nice idea, but doesn''t seem to be in focus to me. Also a little dark.', '2007-11-20 09:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260072, 614525, 80908, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2007-11-20 09:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260078, 614556, 80908, '<td valign="top">The aircraft pops out really well in this one. A little too cropped on the left side for me, but the depth of colours and contrast is great.</td>', 'The aircraft pops out really well in this one. A little too cropped on the left side for me, but the depth of colours and contrast is great.', '2007-11-20 09:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
