(4260323, 614709, 48588, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back &amp; staring at this one, beautiful.</td>', 'I keep coming back & staring at this one, beautiful.', '2007-11-20 12:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260327, 614563, 86849, '<td valign="top">aww. poor doggy must be scared!<br/> <br/>Great shot, i love the off centre position and pure blue sky</td>', 'aww. poor doggy must be scared! Great shot, i love the off centre position and pure blue sky', '2007-11-20 12:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260334, 614709, 51793, '<td valign="top">Well I found a winner already. Good luck, hope to see you in a top ten.</td>', 'Well I found a winner already. Good luck, hope to see you in a top ten.', '2007-11-20 12:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260338, 614144, 51793, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful capture. Lighting is perfect. Not crazy about the boarder though. -1 point for that.  Gave you a 9</td>', 'What a wonderful capture. Lighting is perfect. Not crazy about the boarder though. -1 point for that.  Gave you a 9', '2007-11-20 12:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260339, 613783, 51793, '<td valign="top">Awesome focus on these. Were you on auto focus? Coming back to bump you up to a 10. I really like how you did this.</td>', 'Awesome focus on these. Were you on auto focus? Coming back to bump you up to a 10. I really like how you did this.', '2007-11-20 12:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260503, 612956, 58691, '<td valign="top">I love the duality of this shot. The small light on the hand is a compliment to the large light coming through the window and the left hand just crossing into the other half of the frame connects the two settings. Well done.</td>', 'I love the duality of this shot. The small light on the hand is a compliment to the large light coming through the window and the left hand just crossing into the other half of the frame connects the two settings. Well done.', '2007-11-20 14:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260513, 613657, 58691, '<td valign="top">I think this shot needed a flash. If you lit the child''s back, the brightness of the colors of her outfit and the socks would pop out. I like the angle.</td>', 'I think this shot needed a flash. If you lit the child''s back, the brightness of the colors of her outfit and the socks would pop out. I like the angle.', '2007-11-20 14:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260520, 614465, 58691, '<td valign="top">Great job on the exposure. I like the transition on the bird from white - grey - black and the pinpoint focus on the eye.</td>', 'Great job on the exposure. I like the transition on the bird from white - grey - black and the pinpoint focus on the eye.', '2007-11-20 14:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260523, 614167, 58691, '<td valign="top">A little closer and you would''ve captured the subject''s expression, which I think this photo needs. the shadows are a little strong. Great job on the rule of thirds of the background.</td>', 'A little closer and you would''ve captured the subject''s expression, which I think this photo needs. the shadows are a little strong. Great job on the rule of thirds of the background.', '2007-11-20 14:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260531, 614618, 58691, '<td valign="top">Nice job. The smoke actually looks like a solid. I thought this was converted to greyscale until I noticed the blue lines at the base.</td>', 'Nice job. The smoke actually looks like a solid. I thought this was converted to greyscale until I noticed the blue lines at the base.', '2007-11-20 14:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260537, 614669, 58691, '<td valign="top">I''m curious what is on this child''s face that has attracted the attention of the shooters. The shot is a little busy and has an overly blue tint to it.</td>', 'I''m curious what is on this child''s face that has attracted the attention of the shooters. The shot is a little busy and has an overly blue tint to it.', '2007-11-20 14:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260548, 614663, 58691, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the exposure here and focus is exceptional.</td>', 'Nice job on the exposure here and focus is exceptional.', '2007-11-20 14:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260555, 614468, 58691, '<td valign="top">I like the conversion to greyscale and the noise in this shot, but the glare on the bystander''s face and the gradation of light on the subject hurts the shot.</td>', 'I like the conversion to greyscale and the noise in this shot, but the glare on the bystander''s face and the gradation of light on the subject hurts the shot.', '2007-11-20 14:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260559, 613934, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is a good capture, we positioned and well focused, but it needs soemthign more of interest.</td>', 'This is a good capture, we positioned and well focused, but it needs soemthign more of interest.', '2007-11-20 14:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260565, 614647, 58691, '<td valign="top">I too thought of doing a trampoline shot. You were able to stop the motion but the netting detracts from the activity. This shot would''ve worked better with a wide angle lens and if you were inside the net.</td>', 'I too thought of doing a trampoline shot. You were able to stop the motion but the netting detracts from the activity. This shot would''ve worked better with a wide angle lens and if you were inside the net.', '2007-11-20 14:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260569, 614700, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is a unique shot. I like the separation from the background, yet I like being able to make out background subjects</td>', 'This is a unique shot. I like the separation from the background, yet I like being able to make out background subjects', '2007-11-20 14:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260574, 612859, 58691, '<td valign="top">There is a lot I like about this shot, the eye, the feet tucked under, the aura around the tail feathers and the separation of the tips of the wings. The blown-out underside of the wings is rather harsh though. Still, I think the good outweighs the bad. Nice job.</td>', 'There is a lot I like about this shot, the eye, the feet tucked under, the aura around the tail feathers and the separation of the tips of the wings. The blown-out underside of the wings is rather harsh though. Still, I think the good outweighs the bad. Nice job.', '2007-11-20 14:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260583, 613117, 82816, '<td valign="top">this is amazing! perfect capture! 10!!!!</td>', 'this is amazing! perfect capture! 10!!!!', '2007-11-20 14:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260586, 614657, 58691, '<td valign="top">Bubba? Really? He is adorable, but I don''t see him as a Bubba. :)<br/> <br/>Great job on the exposure. Bubba''s colors are vibrant and alive compared to the background grass. The focus is perfect. You might want to try pulling the rest of the green out of the foreground grass as it draws the eye away from Bubba.</td>', 'Bubba? Really? He is adorable, but I don''t see him as a Bubba. :) Great job on the exposure. Bubba''s colors are vibrant and alive compared to the background grass. The focus is perfect. You might want to try pulling the rest of the green out of the foreground grass as it draws the eye away from Bubba.', '2007-11-20 14:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260590, 613117, 30737, '<td valign="top">I predict a winner here....I would give it a 10 if I could vote!</td>', 'I predict a winner here....I would give it a 10 if I could vote!', '2007-11-20 14:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260593, 613657, 82816, '<td valign="top">great perspective! i love the angles and the stopped motion. could be a little lighter and a little sharper, but that''s just my opinion. great picture anyway! 8</td>', 'great perspective! i love the angles and the stopped motion. could be a little lighter and a little sharper, but that''s just my opinion. great picture anyway! 8', '2007-11-20 14:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260594, 613783, 82816, '<td valign="top">wow! awesome catch! could use a little less sharpening, but an amazing capture anyway! 8</td>', 'wow! awesome catch! could use a little less sharpening, but an amazing capture anyway! 8', '2007-11-20 14:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260600, 614167, 82816, '<td valign="top">great picture, just remember the closer to the ground you are, the higher it''ll look like she''s jumped.... just a thought ;-) 7</td>', 'great picture, just remember the closer to the ground you are, the higher it''ll look like she''s jumped.... just a thought ;-) 7', '2007-11-20 14:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
