(4260626, 613913, 82816, '<td valign="top">WOW! this is incredible! i''m so jealous -- i''ve been trying to get pictures of hummingbirds forever and i''m just not fast enough! amazing job -- 10</td>', 'WOW! this is incredible! i''m so jealous -- i''ve been trying to get pictures of hummingbirds forever and i''m just not fast enough! amazing job -- 10', '2007-11-20 14:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
