(4260649, 614713, 82816, '<td valign="top">wow, crazy!</td>', 'wow, crazy!', '2007-11-20 15:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260658, 613659, 82816, '<td valign="top">see, now i like this. this is a good water drop. 9</td>', 'see, now i like this. this is a good water drop. 9', '2007-11-20 15:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260661, 614055, 82816, '<td valign="top">great capture! nice stopped motion, a little much in pp, but a really cool picture anyway!</td>', 'great capture! nice stopped motion, a little much in pp, but a really cool picture anyway!', '2007-11-20 15:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260662, 614067, 82816, '<td valign="top">really cool! not exactly stopped motion, but really cool!</td>', 'really cool! not exactly stopped motion, but really cool!', '2007-11-20 15:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260663, 614661, 82816, '<td valign="top">awesome perspective! i love the angles and colors and your stopped motion is perfect! incredible! 10</td>', 'awesome perspective! i love the angles and colors and your stopped motion is perfect! incredible! 10', '2007-11-20 15:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260680, 614459, 58691, '<td valign="top">I like this shot for its simplicity and clarity. The grey background is a bit dull and the use of the wide angle lens causes her extended leg to appear slightly larger and out of proportion. The model''s stare is captivating and there is a strength that implied in the "pose" - straight arm, straight leg and the calf muscle. The focus and composition are outstanding. The good definitely outweigh the the two minor negative points. This gets a very high rating from me and added to my favorites. Well done.</td>', 'I like this shot for its simplicity and clarity. The grey background is a bit dull and the use of the wide angle lens causes her extended leg to appear slightly larger and out of proportion. The model''s stare is captivating and there is a strength that implied in the "pose" - straight arm, straight leg and the calf muscle. The focus and composition are outstanding. The good definitely outweigh the the two minor negative points. This gets a very high rating from me and added to my favorites. Well done.', '2007-11-20 15:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260685, 614218, 58691, '<td valign="top">Finally a good battle scene. :) The colors/highlights in the stork/pelican stand out strong against the overcast sky. I hope it shows well on non-calibrated monitors so other voters notice that. Focus/Sharpness is well executed.</td>', 'Finally a good battle scene. :) The colors/highlights in the stork/pelican stand out strong against the overcast sky. I hope it shows well on non-calibrated monitors so other voters notice that. Focus/Sharpness is well executed.', '2007-11-20 15:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260689, 614658, 58691, '<td valign="top">Focus on the berry is a little off and there is a graininess to that is a little distracting. I''m drawn more to the fork than to the berry or the chocolate drop. Maybe if this was lit from a different angle, below the the berry possibly, it would have a better effect.</td>', 'Focus on the berry is a little off and there is a graininess to that is a little distracting. I''m drawn more to the fork than to the berry or the chocolate drop. Maybe if this was lit from a different angle, below the the berry possibly, it would have a better effect.', '2007-11-20 15:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260697, 614710, 58691, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t quite stop the motion. The blur on the tail makes it seem as though it is moving. What really hurts this shot is that the fish is not facing the camera and the spots all over frame are not attractive.</td>', 'This doesn''t quite stop the motion. The blur on the tail makes it seem as though it is moving. What really hurts this shot is that the fish is not facing the camera and the spots all over frame are not attractive.', '2007-11-20 15:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260706, 614674, 58691, '<td valign="top">The subjects are lost against the background and it is difficult to make them out. The first two birds appear headless. The blue water at the top also looks over processed and unnatural. A different angle, possibly with the birds against the water only or the sky would''ve made them stand out more.</td>', 'The subjects are lost against the background and it is difficult to make them out. The first two birds appear headless. The blue water at the top also looks over processed and unnatural. A different angle, possibly with the birds against the water only or the sky would''ve made them stand out more.', '2007-11-20 15:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260720, 614586, 58691, '<td valign="top">You stopped the action very well. The lighting on the side and rear of the dog is good but the shadows weigh heavily on its chest. I''d like to see more of the water in the lower thirds as that would give more focus to the shot. Still, it is nicely done.</td>', 'You stopped the action very well. The lighting on the side and rear of the dog is good but the shadows weigh heavily on its chest. I''d like to see more of the water in the lower thirds as that would give more focus to the shot. Still, it is nicely done.', '2007-11-20 15:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260724, 613380, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is well captured, but the overall greyness of the shot makes it rather dull. The orange tone in the reflection doesn''t add anything. A tighter crop may have helped this a bit.</td>', 'This is well captured, but the overall greyness of the shot makes it rather dull. The orange tone in the reflection doesn''t add anything. A tighter crop may have helped this a bit.', '2007-11-20 15:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260749, 613240, 58691, '<td valign="top">Eventhough this is slightly out of focus and you didn''t completely stop the motion, I really like this shot. It has a certain ethereal or mystical feel to it.</td>', 'Eventhough this is slightly out of focus and you didn''t completely stop the motion, I really like this shot. It has a certain ethereal or mystical feel to it.', '2007-11-20 15:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260755, 614055, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very interesting processing.</td>', 'Very interesting processing.', '2007-11-20 15:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260758, 614144, 23484, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I love the colors</td>', 'Cool shot. I love the colors', '2007-11-20 15:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260766, 614688, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and the starkness of this shot. Good job.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and the starkness of this shot. Good job.', '2007-11-20 15:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260770, 614495, 23484, '<td valign="top">The whole image seems too out of focus.</td>', 'The whole image seems too out of focus.', '2007-11-20 15:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260772, 614690, 58691, '<td valign="top">This certainly fits the challenge, but the shot is lacking any interest or focal point. Oddly, this would be a great setting for a motion capture where the sign is in focus and the traffic blurred.</td>', 'This certainly fits the challenge, but the shot is lacking any interest or focal point. Oddly, this would be a great setting for a motion capture where the sign is in focus and the traffic blurred.', '2007-11-20 15:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260776, 613162, 58691, '<td valign="top">The worm doesn''t really add anything to the shot and the grey background makes the image rather dull. A secondary, colored light source would''ve helped.</td>', 'The worm doesn''t really add anything to the shot and the grey background makes the image rather dull. A secondary, colored light source would''ve helped.', '2007-11-20 15:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260781, 614699, 58691, '<td valign="top">There is an absence of clarity to this image and it is difficult to make sense of the subject.</td>', 'There is an absence of clarity to this image and it is difficult to make sense of the subject.', '2007-11-20 15:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260790, 614673, 58691, '<td valign="top">There is a nice balance to this composition. I think you should''ve cloned out the tire at the top of the frame and possibly masked the the car and upped the red to make it pop out a bit more.</td>', 'There is a nice balance to this composition. I think you should''ve cloned out the tire at the top of the frame and possibly masked the the car and upped the red to make it pop out a bit more.', '2007-11-20 15:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260794, 614679, 58691, '<td valign="top">Love it! It took me a second to locate the ball, but this you captured her very well. Nice job.</td>', 'Love it! It took me a second to locate the ball, but this you captured her very well. Nice job.', '2007-11-20 15:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260800, 614695, 58691, '<td valign="top">Not sure the greyscale helps this this one out. Overall it is a dull image. it doesn''t portray the feeling of stopped motion, but more of a sleeping cat.</td>', 'Not sure the greyscale helps this this one out. Overall it is a dull image. it doesn''t portray the feeling of stopped motion, but more of a sleeping cat.', '2007-11-20 16:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
