(4260889, 614015, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is very well done and an interesting take in the many splash images in this challenge. Well-lit and nicely composed.</td>', 'This is very well done and an interesting take in the many splash images in this challenge. Well-lit and nicely composed.', '2007-11-20 16:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260896, 614054, 58691, '<td valign="top">Good capture. the focus on the right wing instead of the left hurts this image a bit, but it is still a quality capture.</td>', 'Good capture. the focus on the right wing instead of the left hurts this image a bit, but it is still a quality capture.', '2007-11-20 16:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260901, 613752, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2007-11-20 16:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260905, 614598, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is a very good shot and I like it a lot, but I get the impression that this is a pose and that there is no motion that is being stopped. Of course, my perception may be wrong. If this was a challenge other than Stopped Motion, I would''ve rated it one of the top images.</td>', 'This is a very good shot and I like it a lot, but I get the impression that this is a pose and that there is no motion that is being stopped. Of course, my perception may be wrong. If this was a challenge other than Stopped Motion, I would''ve rated it one of the top images.', '2007-11-20 16:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260918, 614575, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot and I like the way you processed this. The angle really gives it a neat effect.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot and I like the way you processed this. The angle really gives it a neat effect.', '2007-11-20 16:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260920, 614672, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot and perfect execution.</td>', 'Excellent shot and perfect execution.', '2007-11-20 16:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260925, 613913, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent profile of the the hummingbird and the sharpness and richness of the colors are out standing. When you think of how fast the wings are moving, the capture is even more impressive. There is excellent separation between the subject and the background which makes the bird almost pop out of the image. Well done.</td>', 'This is an excellent profile of the the hummingbird and the sharpness and richness of the colors are out standing. When you think of how fast the wings are moving, the capture is even more impressive. There is excellent separation between the subject and the background which makes the bird almost pop out of the image. Well done.', '2007-11-20 16:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260933, 613148, 58691, '<td valign="top">Two steps to the left or right and this would''ve made a decent image. as it is, you totally obscure the subject with the mic. Additionally, the keyboard is slightly slanted to the right. This is an advanced challenge so you could''ve also clones out the person on the left of the image.</td>', 'Two steps to the left or right and this would''ve made a decent image. as it is, you totally obscure the subject with the mic. Additionally, the keyboard is slightly slanted to the right. This is an advanced challenge so you could''ve also clones out the person on the left of the image.', '2007-11-20 16:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260942, 614691, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is close to a very good shot, but the lack of focus on the head of the dog hurts it. This is an advanced challenge so you could''ve cloned out the chain link fence in the background.</td>', 'This is close to a very good shot, but the lack of focus on the head of the dog hurts it. This is an advanced challenge so you could''ve cloned out the chain link fence in the background.', '2007-11-20 16:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260950, 614714, 58691, '<td valign="top">Cute shot and you captured the activity well. There is still motion showing on their feet and a blur on the ball.</td>', 'Cute shot and you captured the activity well. There is still motion showing on their feet and a blur on the ball.', '2007-11-20 16:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260957, 614672, 58691, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this a number of times and I think it is just a little too chaotic. The foreground blur takes away from what would otherwise be an amazing capture amazing capture.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this a number of times and I think it is just a little too chaotic. The foreground blur takes away from what would otherwise be an amazing capture amazing capture.', '2007-11-20 17:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260963, 614661, 58691, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but something about the subject and the background don''t exactly mesh. I think it is the urban feel of the background, which on it''s own would be a very good shot, and the preppyness of the subjects appearance and outfit that put them in conflict. Technically, I think this is very good and I am scoring it very well, but that nuance keeps it from being in the 8-10 range.</td>', 'I like this shot, but something about the subject and the background don''t exactly mesh. I think it is the urban feel of the background, which on it''s own would be a very good shot, and the preppyness of the subjects appearance and outfit that put them in conflict. Technically, I think this is very good and I am scoring it very well, but that nuance keeps it from being in the 8-10 range.', '2007-11-20 17:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260968, 613598, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot. I would like to see more definition in the face of the dog, but other than that, this is well done.</td>', 'This is a good shot. I would like to see more definition in the face of the dog, but other than that, this is well done.', '2007-11-20 17:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260976, 614708, 58691, '<td valign="top">While the image suffers a bit from the lighting, the flight of the bird following the corridor created by the light and the angle of the clouds is excellent. Well done.</td>', 'While the image suffers a bit from the lighting, the flight of the bird following the corridor created by the light and the angle of the clouds is excellent. Well done.', '2007-11-20 17:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260979, 614458, 58691, '<td valign="top">The bright yellow background is a bit overpowering and I keep looking for where the focus of the shot is and I can''t find it. The concept was good, but a strong focus on the water line or the lime would''ve helped.</td>', 'The bright yellow background is a bit overpowering and I keep looking for where the focus of the shot is and I can''t find it. The concept was good, but a strong focus on the water line or the lime would''ve helped.', '2007-11-20 17:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4260986, 614543, 58691, '<td valign="top">Perfect capture on the subjects and I love the blue reflection on the white uniforms, but the old school fire engine totally disrupts the image. It is a shame because the stopped motion is dead on.</td>', 'Perfect capture on the subjects and I love the blue reflection on the white uniforms, but the old school fire engine totally disrupts the image. It is a shame because the stopped motion is dead on.', '2007-11-20 17:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
