(4264051, 614462, 58691, '<td valign="top">This reminds me a of a shot I once did titled High Speed Access... only yours is much better. It is great that you captured the subject before she got to the blue door as that she would''ve blended in too well. The only issue I see with this is that the top of the blue door is clipped, but that is very minor. The positives greatly outweigh that small negative. This is not just one of my favorites in this challenge, but in all of DPC. Great job.</td>', 'This reminds me a of a shot I once did titled High Speed Access... only yours is much better. It is great that you captured the subject before she got to the blue door as that she would''ve blended in too well. The only issue I see with this is that the top of the blue door is clipped, but that is very minor. The positives greatly outweigh that small negative. This is not just one of my favorites in this challenge, but in all of DPC. Great job.', '2007-11-22 00:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
