(4264342, 614669, 81382, '<td valign="top">Bit of a blue colour cast that could easily be corrected. Not sure this is quite in the spirit of the challenge despite your title. Better than another water drop though</td>', 'Bit of a blue colour cast that could easily be corrected. Not sure this is quite in the spirit of the challenge despite your title. Better than another water drop though', '2007-11-22 08:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4264344, 614690, 81382, '<td valign="top">I know the cars are moving, but they might as well be stuck in a traffic jam. Setup wise, this is easily repeatable, at least compared to the ones that require spot on timing or make a mess (water, milk splashes all over the kitchen floor) and need to be "reset" between each shot so I''m afraid when compared to those, I can''t score this as high.</td>', 'I know the cars are moving, but they might as well be stuck in a traffic jam. Setup wise, this is easily repeatable, at least compared to the ones that require spot on timing or make a mess (water, milk splashes all over the kitchen floor) and need to be "reset" between each shot so I''m afraid when compared to those, I can''t score this as high.', '2007-11-22 08:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4264347, 614726, 81382, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the head, to do that and get the freezed motion is tricky so well done. You''ve gone for a mono conversion which I agree with, the levels/contrast could be pushed a bit harder though to really give this some impact. Nice water drops too</td>', 'Good focus on the head, to do that and get the freezed motion is tricky so well done. You''ve gone for a mono conversion which I agree with, the levels/contrast could be pushed a bit harder though to really give this some impact. Nice water drops too', '2007-11-22 08:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4264348, 614719, 81382, '<td valign="top">I worry this is too complex to score highly, a more neutral background to keep this simpler I suspect would have done better. To improve composition, I would have gone for a more widescreen aspect ratio and opened up more space on the right hand side to keep the bird one third over to the left.</td>', 'I worry this is too complex to score highly, a more neutral background to keep this simpler I suspect would have done better. To improve composition, I would have gone for a more widescreen aspect ratio and opened up more space on the right hand side to keep the bird one third over to the left.', '2007-11-22 08:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4264352, 614218, 81382, '<td valign="top">Amazing sharpness, especially on the brown feathers. Nice neutral background keeps things simple so this should do well. Theres something not quite right with the composition though, both birds are looking/moving into the right hand side so there should be more empty space there, but this would bring the perch into the centre which breaks the rule of thirds, unless of course you made lots of empty space on the right but then it might look a bit silly.</td>', 'Amazing sharpness, especially on the brown feathers. Nice neutral background keeps things simple so this should do well. Theres something not quite right with the composition though, both birds are looking/moving into the right hand side so there should be more empty space there, but this would bring the perch into the centre which breaks the rule of thirds, unless of course you made lots of empty space on the right but then it might look a bit silly.', '2007-11-22 08:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4264354, 614598, 81382, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge for me I''m afraid. I can see where you were going with this "stopped time" type thing but its not right here.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge for me I''m afraid. I can see where you were going with this "stopped time" type thing but its not right here.', '2007-11-22 08:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4264356, 614657, 81382, '<td valign="top">Great background blur whilst retaining sharpness on the dog. A complete mid air capture would have been more impressive but this has great colours and is well composed. The background is quite red though and so you lose contrast with the main subject, would be better if the background was either more complementary or neutral</td>', 'Great background blur whilst retaining sharpness on the dog. A complete mid air capture would have been more impressive but this has great colours and is well composed. The background is quite red though and so you lose contrast with the main subject, would be better if the background was either more complementary or neutral', '2007-11-22 08:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4264414, 614459, 69368, '<td valign="top">great conzept well executed. Very good sharpness, lighting and composition. Well done!</td>', 'great conzept well executed. Very good sharpness, lighting and composition. Well done!', '2007-11-22 09:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
