(4265009, 614710, 45524, '<td valign="top">I would say most voters arent going to like this. However something about this photo appeals to me. It has the old time film effect with it. and I think the noise actually helps it become a stronger image. I''m going to guess this finishes in the low 5 to upper 4''s with the voters but my vote is a 7.</td>', 'I would say most voters arent going to like this. However something about this photo appeals to me. It has the old time film effect with it. and I think the noise actually helps it become a stronger image. I''m going to guess this finishes in the low 5 to upper 4''s with the voters but my vote is a 7.', '2007-11-22 20:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4265010, 614667, 45524, '<td valign="top">I wish the focus had been a bit sharper, you definatley stopped the action but neither of the objects seem to be very sharp.</td>', 'I wish the focus had been a bit sharper, you definatley stopped the action but neither of the objects seem to be very sharp.', '2007-11-22 20:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
