(4265258, 613657, 69325, '<td valign="top">man i dont know what to do here......i LOVE this shot initially, great perspective and the stockinged feet kicking up in the air are great. at first i thought "what the heck is the deal with that big burned area in the corner?" but then i read your title again and i think i get it. therefore i will push past my initial reaction and try to get into the spirit that i THINK you are trying to convey, that of a girl swinging right from her own backyard and out into space....yes...i like it...no love it, great work and great creative thinking whoever you are....a big fat 10 and a fav</td>', 'man i dont know what to do here......i LOVE this shot initially, great perspective and the stockinged feet kicking up in the air are great. at first i thought "what the heck is the deal with that big burned area in the corner?" but then i read your title again and i think i get it. therefore i will push past my initial reaction and try to get into the spirit that i THINK you are trying to convey, that of a girl swinging right from her own backyard and out into space....yes...i like it...no love it, great work and great creative thinking whoever you are....a big fat 10 and a fav', '2007-11-22 23:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
