(4268836, 614667, 66384, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i> This is so cool - it''s like water lost it''s sense of gravity at this moment. What a fun picture! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>What an interesting observation. I really felt there was something magical about this image, but I couldn''t put my finger on exactly what was creating that effect. Since the water drops were stopped as they were rising, it really does give the feel of weightlessness. Thanks for this very astute comment.</td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival: This is so cool - it''s like water lost it''s sense of gravity at this moment. What a fun picture!  What an interesting observation. I really felt there was something magical about this image, but I couldn''t put my finger on exactly what was creating that effect. Since the water drops were stopped as they were rising, it really does give the feel of weightlessness. Thanks for this very astute comment.', '2007-11-26 00:29:51.000000', NULL, 0),
