(4268950, 614150, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this shot. It''s almost as if you designed the shot and painted it. Great capture under very difficult conditions. The first thing that caught my eye here is the incredible color -- the blue and gold almost jump off the screen. I am amazed at the score, and I can only guess that people knocked it down because of the motion blur.</td>', 'I love the composition of this shot. It''s almost as if you designed the shot and painted it. Great capture under very difficult conditions. The first thing that caught my eye here is the incredible color -- the blue and gold almost jump off the screen. I am amazed at the score, and I can only guess that people knocked it down because of the motion blur.', '2007-11-26 01:38:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4268952, 614672, 18450, '<td valign="top">What amazing persistence and what a great shot! Hope you enjoyed your wine :D</td>', 'What amazing persistence and what a great shot! Hope you enjoyed your wine :D', '2007-11-26 01:40:11.000000', NULL, 0),
