(4269039, 614150, 68035, '<td valign="top">I really like sports shots and this is a good one as it really catches a slice of the action.<br/> <br/>I like the way that you have made the colours so deep and vibrant (especially given that this looks like a night time game played under lights).  Nice composition as well<br/> <br/>I guess where this may have suffered is the fact that the red players (especially the one catching the ball) appear to have a bit of motion blur which people may have marked down (despite the fact that yellow top is captured sans blur)<br/> <br/>Definitely not a sub 5 shot!</td>', 'I really like sports shots and this is a good one as it really catches a slice of the action. I like the way that you have made the colours so deep and vibrant (especially given that this looks like a night time game played under lights).  Nice composition as well I guess where this may have suffered is the fact that the red players (especially the one catching the ball) appear to have a bit of motion blur which people may have marked down (despite the fact that yellow top is captured sans blur) Definitely not a sub 5 shot!', '2007-11-26 03:58:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4269041, 613117, 34938, '<td valign="top">First Ribbon David...fantastic. Another Australian everybody!!!</td>', 'First Ribbon David...fantastic. Another Australian everybody!!!', '2007-11-26 04:16:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4269042, 613799, 68035, '<td valign="top">Yaaaay!!!!  Congratulations on your second 6+ score!!!<br/> <br/>I love this photo, especially the way you have captured the leaves in perfect stop motion and that they are curving back on themselves like a wave breaking on the shoreline.  Beautiful rich autumnal colours as well<br/> <br/>Just lovely</td>', 'Yaaaay!!!!  Congratulations on your second 6+ score!!! I love this photo, especially the way you have captured the leaves in perfect stop motion and that they are curving back on themselves like a wave breaking on the shoreline.  Beautiful rich autumnal colours as well Just lovely', '2007-11-26 04:17:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4269045, 614493, 34938, '<td valign="top">Irene, Irene, Irene...I bet that when you grow up you want to be a mermaid! You have this thing about water!!! Well deserved ribbon. I know the idea is not original, but this is one of my favourites of this type of image. I love the colours in the water above...you are running H. O. T. at the moment, keep it up.</td>', 'Irene, Irene, Irene...I bet that when you grow up you want to be a mermaid! You have this thing about water!!! Well deserved ribbon. I know the idea is not original, but this is one of my favourites of this type of image. I love the colours in the water above...you are running H. O. T. at the moment, keep it up.', '2007-11-26 04:20:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4269046, 614661, 34938, '<td valign="top">Thought this would do well...congrats on the ribbon</td>', 'Thought this would do well...congrats on the ribbon', '2007-11-26 04:21:22.000000', NULL, 0),
