(4269048, 614679, 68035, '<td valign="top">Not just a catch....A GREAT catch.<br/> <br/>Fantastic stop motion, a picture that is alive with vibrancy.  Stunned at the fact that so much of the frame is in sharp focus (especially at f5.0!)<br/> <br/>Love the way that the dog has reacted to the ball going past him and following the line of vision takes you to the ball itself.<br/> <br/>For me the fact that the ball is on the dge of the shot (pretty much on a rule of third point) actually adds to the image rather than takes from it)<br/> <br/>Great image</td>', 'Not just a catch....A GREAT catch. Fantastic stop motion, a picture that is alive with vibrancy.  Stunned at the fact that so much of the frame is in sharp focus (especially at f5.0!) Love the way that the dog has reacted to the ball going past him and following the line of vision takes you to the ball itself. For me the fact that the ball is on the dge of the shot (pretty much on a rule of third point) actually adds to the image rather than takes from it) Great image', '2007-11-26 04:22:19.000000', NULL, 0),
