(4269100, 614672, 24486, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top ten placing. I am so glad to see this placing so well. I was fairly sure I wasn''t looking at a bullet in flight but I couldn''t workout how else you cold get an apple to explode like that. It was worth all the time &amp; effort</td>', 'Congrats on the top ten placing. I am so glad to see this placing so well. I was fairly sure I wasn''t looking at a bullet in flight but I couldn''t workout how else you cold get an apple to explode like that. It was worth all the time & effort', '2007-11-26 05:16:07.000000', NULL, 0),
