(4269106, 614149, 67152, '<td valign="top">Richard - Excellent work and congrats on finishing top 10.  This should be on the cover of Field and Stream.  The composition is outstanding and the yellow line really pulls our eyes around the image.</td>', 'Richard - Excellent work and congrats on finishing top 10.  This should be on the cover of Field and Stream.  The composition is outstanding and the yellow line really pulls our eyes around the image.', '2007-11-26 05:33:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4269111, 614085, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice finish with this one Oliver.  Excellent technique and well delivered shot.  I like how the water stopped shows us the path - and this is probably why you entered it.  <br/> <br/>I think the background in this one is a bit distracting - almost like there are some dust bunnies on your sensor (right at the top where the water is entering and againat the far left of the image) and this probably cost you some points.</td>', 'Nice finish with this one Oliver.  Excellent technique and well delivered shot.  I like how the water stopped shows us the path - and this is probably why you entered it.   I think the background in this one is a bit distracting - almost like there are some dust bunnies on your sensor (right at the top where the water is entering and againat the far left of the image) and this probably cost you some points.', '2007-11-26 05:39:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4269113, 614134, 67152, '<td valign="top">JB - Awesome image!  the lighting, the wave, the surfer, the colors - all outstanding.  Congrats on the high score and the top 5 finish</td>', 'JB - Awesome image!  the lighting, the wave, the surfer, the colors - all outstanding.  Congrats on the high score and the top 5 finish', '2007-11-26 05:42:10.000000', NULL, 0),
