(4269118, 614067, 30861, '<td valign="top">You were absolutely robbed by voters who are fixated on the "obvious" approaches to stop-motion. They have no idea how difficult this is to do. Lovely astronomical image, and in my opinion right on-topic to boot.</td>', 'You were absolutely robbed by voters who are fixated on the "obvious" approaches to stop-motion. They have no idea how difficult this is to do. Lovely astronomical image, and in my opinion right on-topic to boot.', '2007-11-26 05:49:01.000000', NULL, 0),
