(4269207, 614572, 68035, '<td valign="top">Andrew<br/> <br/>I thought this was a great shot.  I loved the shallow dof and for me the border worked well.  5.75 is a good score but I think it deserved much higher</td>', 'Andrew I thought this was a great shot.  I loved the shallow dof and for me the border worked well.  5.75 is a good score but I think it deserved much higher', '2007-11-26 07:36:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4269210, 614672, 82503, '<td valign="top">Wow, wow, wow, Sean, I''m really impressed by the effort that went into this. So it''s really "real". Awesome!<br/> <br/>I think this shot should have won a ribbon. You probably got low votes from the people who express their socio-political views on guns (or apples. ;-) ) this way instead of rating the quality of the picture.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-26 10:35:47.</i></td>', 'Wow, wow, wow, Sean, I''m really impressed by the effort that went into this. So it''s really "real". Awesome! I think this shot should have won a ribbon. You probably got low votes from the people who express their socio-political views on guns (or apples. ;-) ) this way instead of rating the quality of the picture.', '2007-11-26 07:46:33.000000', '2007-11-26 10:35:47.000000', 0),
(4269219, 614176, 63398, '<td valign="top">Mary, what a great capture! It''s dark and moody making the cracker-nabbing parrot look ominous even if we do know she''s a love.</td>', 'Mary, what a great capture! It''s dark and moody making the cracker-nabbing parrot look ominous even if we do know she''s a love.', '2007-11-26 07:57:42.000000', NULL, 0),
