(4269353, 614221, 66384, '<td valign="top">Yep, you stopped the motion too well. Perhaps if there was a shot with the sword above his head, the motion would have been a little more apparent.</td>', 'Yep, you stopped the motion too well. Perhaps if there was a shot with the sword above his head, the motion would have been a little more apparent.', '2007-11-26 09:36:31.000000', NULL, 0),
