(4269363, 614672, 66414, '<td valign="top">After reading your pain staking story, I think a better title for the picture would be Apple Sauce!<br/>Well done, I can''t imagine what the studio must have looked like after 50 apples</td>', 'After reading your pain staking story, I think a better title for the picture would be Apple Sauce!Well done, I can''t imagine what the studio must have looked like after 50 apples', '2007-11-26 09:46:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4269382, 614150, 34462, '<td valign="top">Wow. I am surprised that this scored so poorly. The focus is right on, the brightness is there, it is a tough shot and you nailed it all but the ball. It''s a good thing you don''t grade your students so rigidly.</td>', 'Wow. I am surprised that this scored so poorly. The focus is right on, the brightness is there, it is a tough shot and you nailed it all but the ball. It''s a good thing you don''t grade your students so rigidly.', '2007-11-26 10:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4269385, 613799, 34462, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a good score. The colors are beautiful and the leaves are stopped and the BG is bokeh. AND that''s Jon''s leg? Haha that''s great!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congrats on a good score. The colors are beautiful and the leaves are stopped and the BG is bokeh. AND that''s Jon''s leg? Haha that''s great! ', '2007-11-26 10:05:44.000000', NULL, 0),
