(4272952, 613913, 23430, '<td valign="top">Way to go Ann. I''m very impressed. This is the sharpest humming Bird shot I''ve seen. The flash does the trick alright. Looks fantastic in front of the nice soft background. This deserves the very high score it got. Congratulations.</td>', 'Way to go Ann. I''m very impressed. This is the sharpest humming Bird shot I''ve seen. The flash does the trick alright. Looks fantastic in front of the nice soft background. This deserves the very high score it got. Congratulations.', '2007-11-28 06:20:57.000000', NULL, 0),
