(4273385, 614698, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hi Techo,<br/>       Nice effort, The time an effort it takes captureing these images is remarkable. For those that complain about them try doing it first and find out what a major pain in the ass they really are :). As for this image I like the compostion, the placement is nice and I like the feel of motion you get at the bottom of the image and the stop motion on your main subject, nicely done. However I do think there is to much dead space here and the lighting is to strong causeing a bit of over exposure and a lose of some detail on the bottom third of the image. Maybe bounceing the light would have helped tone down the brightness a bit. Your main subject here could have used a little sharpening also. The use of the border here really didn''t help much either.</td>', 'Hi Techo,       Nice effort, The time an effort it takes captureing these images is remarkable. For those that complain about them try doing it first and find out what a major pain in the ass they really are :). As for this image I like the compostion, the placement is nice and I like the feel of motion you get at the bottom of the image and the stop motion on your main subject, nicely done. However I do think there is to much dead space here and the lighting is to strong causeing a bit of over exposure and a lose of some detail on the bottom third of the image. Maybe bounceing the light would have helped tone down the brightness a bit. Your main subject here could have used a little sharpening also. The use of the border here really didn''t help much either.', '2007-11-28 11:13:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4273905, 613485, 80296, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Flip it over and look at it upside down.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Flip it over and look at it upside down.', '2007-11-28 13:36:42.000000', NULL, 0),
