(4275389, 613117, 86298, '<td valign="top">This is the coolest picture I have EVER seen. Please tell me how you did it. Was the set up intricit. I''m flabergasted that you didn''t get first. This is the first picture I''m putting into my favorites. And trust me, I am a very tuff judge...</td>', 'This is the coolest picture I have EVER seen. Please tell me how you did it. Was the set up intricit. I''m flabergasted that you didn''t get first. This is the first picture I''m putting into my favorites. And trust me, I am a very tuff judge...', '2007-11-29 02:53:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4275495, 614525, 22781, '<td valign="top"><b>Hi from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>Wow, insect macro, I always love these.<br/>And it fits the challenge well.<br/>There is not much to critique about this photo,<br/>it is sharp, nice colors, good subject, meets the challenge.<br/>The only thing that I would have liked is that the bee was totaly in the picture and not obscured by the foreground leafs, but I understand that this is a hard thing to capture.<br/> <br/>As I said, there is not much more you could have done, and I realy like it.<br/></td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club  Wow, insect macro, I always love these.And it fits the challenge well.There is not much to critique about this photo,it is sharp, nice colors, good subject, meets the challenge.The only thing that I would have liked is that the bee was totaly in the picture and not obscured by the foreground leafs, but I understand that this is a hard thing to capture. As I said, there is not much more you could have done, and I realy like it.', '2007-11-29 06:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
