(4276006, 613354, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hi Marc,<br/>      Wonderful capture, I really like the placement of the match here. The smoke is also placed well &amp; it''s color I think complement the image. The overall composition here is very well done. Love the timing catching the ignition with just a hint of flame it''s really well done. The image is nice and crisp the colors are great not overpowering. I like the detail here catching the sulf coming off the match,excellent. Overall this is a really nice image and I would have scored it at 8. Great image !!!</td>', 'Hi Marc,      Wonderful capture, I really like the placement of the match here. The smoke is also placed well & it''s color I think complement the image. The overall composition here is very well done. Love the timing catching the ignition with just a hint of flame it''s really well done. The image is nice and crisp the colors are great not overpowering. I like the detail here catching the sulf coming off the match,excellent. Overall this is a really nice image and I would have scored it at 8. Great image !!!', '2007-11-29 11:07:44.000000', NULL, 0),
