(4282385, 614710, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hi Freak,<br/>       I Like the compostion of the image and the back ground color fits nicely here. However the image seems out of focus. The belly is blownout &amp; I really don\''t get the feeling of \"stopped motion\". The glass is a bit dirty which is a bit of a distraction also. Having a 220 gal reef tank &amp; taken a number of images try this in the future. Leaving the pump system on use your flash above the tank app 24 to 30 inches from the top of water &amp; position yourself 30 to 36 inchs from the tank. The water along with it\''s movement seems to defuse the flash just right. Also the use of a black light works wonders really brings out the color variatons of the fish and it\''s surroundings.</td>', 'Hi Freak,       I Like the compostion of the image and the back ground color fits nicely here. However the image seems out of focus. The belly is blownout & I really don\''t get the feeling of \"stopped motion\". The glass is a bit dirty which is a bit of a distraction also. Having a 220 gal reef tank & taken a number of images try this in the future. Leaving the pump system on use your flash above the tank app 24 to 30 inches from the top of water & position yourself 30 to 36 inchs from the tank. The water along with it\''s movement seems to defuse the flash just right. Also the use of a black light works wonders really brings out the color variatons of the fish and it\''s surroundings.', '2007-12-02 10:50:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4282403, 614667, 62318, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot Juli. I like the fact it feels like snow, but in reality is a different medium. Very memorable picture for years to come.</td>', 'Beautiful shot Juli. I like the fact it feels like snow, but in reality is a different medium. Very memorable picture for years to come.', '2007-12-02 10:59:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4282406, 613799, 62318, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting in this and the wonderful movement being felt here.</td>', 'Love the lighting in this and the wonderful movement being felt here.', '2007-12-02 11:00:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4282421, 614150, 62318, '<td valign="top">A good decisive moment you managed you capture. I like the competing colors as it really gives balanace to the photo. I would be tempted to crop out the crowd on the top and make it more of a 8x10 landscape. Still good stuff.</td>', 'A good decisive moment you managed you capture. I like the competing colors as it really gives balanace to the photo. I would be tempted to crop out the crowd on the top and make it more of a 8x10 landscape. Still good stuff.', '2007-12-02 11:07:13.000000', NULL, 0),
