(4317589, 614693, 50931, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Debbi:</b></div><hr/><i> Where would I find the Woods shutter beam?<br/>Debbi </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.woodselec.com/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.woodselec.com/</a> <br/>it isn''t cheap, but it is an amazing device for high speed photography.<br/>the site has useful information about the technical matters to consider when shooting like this. like how much time does it take for the sound to reach the microphone which triggers the shot? (about 1/1000 second for every foot of distance between the source and the mic). these delays mecome critical when you are photographing "instantaneous" events</td>', 'Originally posted by Debbi: Where would I find the Woods shutter beam?Debbi   //www.woodselec.com/ it isn''t cheap, but it is an amazing device for high speed photography.the site has useful information about the technical matters to consider when shooting like this. like how much time does it take for the sound to reach the microphone which triggers the shot? (about 1/1000 second for every foot of distance between the source and the mic). these delays mecome critical when you are photographing "instantaneous" events', '2007-12-16 22:28:14.000000', NULL, 0),
