(4327231, 614562, 60862, '<td valign="top">First, sorry to hear about your puppy.<br/> <br/>That said, ha!  What a wonderful, joyous celebration of youth and life.  I''m so happy for you that you got this with kids you care about, and who obviously care about you.  And I''m also happy the voters recognized this for the triumph it is. :)  Going in my faves.</td>', 'First, sorry to hear about your puppy. That said, ha!  What a wonderful, joyous celebration of youth and life.  I''m so happy for you that you got this with kids you care about, and who obviously care about you.  And I''m also happy the voters recognized this for the triumph it is. :)  Going in my faves.', '2007-12-20 23:51:19.000000', NULL, 0),
