(4346981, 614387, 30982, '<td valign="top">Somehow I missed this - what a treasure to find it!  Incredibly spot on exposure to get such wonderful detail on the bird and the light coming through the feathers.  Simple a perfect shot!</td>', 'Somehow I missed this - what a treasure to find it!  Incredibly spot on exposure to get such wonderful detail on the bird and the light coming through the feathers.  Simple a perfect shot!', '2007-12-31 06:59:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4351744, 614387, 88411, '<td valign="top">Very angelic with a ton of appeal. I think a slightly darker b/g would also work here as an altenative look with your perfectly lit, beautiful bird. LJM.</td>', 'Very angelic with a ton of appeal. I think a slightly darker b/g would also work here as an altenative look with your perfectly lit, beautiful bird. LJM.', '2008-01-01 21:28:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4365136, 614176, 32872, '<td valign="top">She is beautiful!!  You did her justice...nice image, well-done!  I really do love this one.</td>', 'She is beautiful!!  You did her justice...nice image, well-done!  I really do love this one.', '2008-01-06 02:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4373517, 613657, 3087, '<td valign="top">An interesting image, certainly different from the norm in terms of composition and content.<br/> <br/>Although I normally like face-on portraits of children I like the way that the anonymity of the model makes it a more universal image - more about the theme/ idea/ story than the individual.<br/> <br/>The foliage at bottom left is a little too confused being so near to where I''d expect the head to be, and similar in colour to the model''s hair. I''d like to see a pose with the back of the head more obviously included. <br/> <br/>The clouds and sky and reflected foliage top right are nice.<br/> <br/>Nor sure about the triangle of orange lower right.<br/> <br/>I''m in two minds about the black at top left. On one hand it connects with the title of the photograph. On the other, that theme/ idea doesn''t come across at all without the title. Then again, why should it, since there''s no reason an artist can''t choose to present the image and title as a whole, always to be shown together...<br/> <br/></td>', 'An interesting image, certainly different from the norm in terms of composition and content. Although I normally like face-on portraits of children I like the way that the anonymity of the model makes it a more universal image - more about the theme/ idea/ story than the individual. The foliage at bottom left is a little too confused being so near to where I''d expect the head to be, and similar in colour to the model''s hair. I''d like to see a pose with the back of the head more obviously included.  The clouds and sky and reflected foliage top right are nice. Nor sure about the triangle of orange lower right. I''m in two minds about the black at top left. On one hand it connects with the title of the photograph. On the other, that theme/ idea doesn''t come across at all without the title. Then again, why should it, since there''s no reason an artist can''t choose to present the image and title as a whole, always to be shown together... ', '2008-01-08 10:05:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4388456, 613989, 68504, '<td valign="top">A very modren van Goght at that.  Brilliantly obscure.</td>', 'A very modren van Goght at that.  Brilliantly obscure.', '2008-01-13 01:33:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4401259, 613913, 53039, '<td valign="top">Obviously a great shot.  Even better work describing how you did it.  Much appreciated.</td>', 'Obviously a great shot.  Even better work describing how you did it.  Much appreciated.', '2008-01-17 19:55:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4422620, 613657, 49804, '<td valign="top">This perspective is absolutely awesome, it took me a little bit to figure out how the camera was being held, very cool shot, with great colors.</td>', 'This perspective is absolutely awesome, it took me a little bit to figure out how the camera was being held, very cool shot, with great colors.', '2008-01-24 19:24:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4436529, 614176, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is a very good image, even with the things that you mention about "quality issues".   Most of us know the techniques to get the great shot, but it just isn''t always easy as time never stands still with animals or people.  <br/>Capturing a hundred one time, exceptional moments like this is worth a lot more to me than missing most of life and it''s great images while trying to get that one technically perfect shot.</td>', 'This is a very good image, even with the things that you mention about "quality issues".   Most of us know the techniques to get the great shot, but it just isn''t always easy as time never stands still with animals or people.  Capturing a hundred one time, exceptional moments like this is worth a lot more to me than missing most of life and it''s great images while trying to get that one technically perfect shot.', '2008-01-29 12:56:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4457568, 613117, 41479, '<td valign="top">SO cool</td>', 'SO cool', '2008-02-04 14:49:15.000000', NULL, 0),
