(5633423, 614054, 71886, '<td valign="top">Great job stopping the motion here.  Your exposure looks spot on to me.  Just wondering if this is a large crop because you took it with the 70-200, or did you actually get super close?   My nitpicks are that the bush is a little distracting and I would like to see a bit more room for him to fly into.  Great job though, osprey are one of my favorite birds to observe.</td>', 'Great job stopping the motion here.  Your exposure looks spot on to me.  Just wondering if this is a large crop because you took it with the 70-200, or did you actually get super close?   My nitpicks are that the bush is a little distracting and I would like to see a bit more room for him to fly into.  Great job though, osprey are one of my favorite birds to observe.', '2009-09-02 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
